# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Development Project Template — .gitignore
# Docs + agent-config project (no build/test/lint pipeline).
# Scaffolder lives in Setup/template-dev-installer/.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Windows reserved device names — if a script redirects to one of these
# expecting /dev/null on Unix (or NUL in cmd) but runs under Git Bash/MSYS2,
# it creates a real file instead. These files break `git add`, so ignore them.
nul
con
prn
aux
com1
com2
com3
com4
com5
com6
com7
com8
com9
lpt1
lpt2
lpt3
lpt4
lpt5
lpt6
lpt7
lpt8
lpt9

# ── Dependencies ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Never commit installed packages. Applies to Setup/template-dev-installer
# and any agent submodule deps. (Submodules manage their own ignores.)
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js
.yarn/cache
.yarn/install-state.gz

# ── Secrets & local environment ────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local
*.secret

# ── Logs & runtime data ─────────────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock

# ── Subagent run artifacts ───────────────────────────────────
# pi-subagents writes per-run transcripts, inputs, outputs, and meta to
# .pi-subagents/artifacts/. These files capture RAW tool I/O, which has
# already leaked a live API key once (GitHub Push Protection blocked the
# push). They are ephemeral debug data, not source — stop tracking them.
# Note: .gitignore only blocks UNtracked files; the ~123 files already
# committed were untracked via `git rm --cached -r .pi-subagents/artifacts/`.
.pi-subagents/artifacts/

# ── Skill runtime caches ────────────────────────────────────
# model-benchmarks skill: live fetch cache must never churn the repo.
# Offline test fixture stays tracked at
# .agents/skills/model-benchmarks/tests/fixtures/cache.json.
.agents/skills/model-benchmarks/cache/

# ── Build output & caches ───────────────────────────────────
# No build pipeline today; harmless if one is added later.
dist/
build/
out/
.cache/
*.tsbuildinfo
.npm/
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache
.parcel-cache/
.turbo/
coverage/
*.lcov

# ── OS junk ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.fseventsd
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ── Editor / IDE per-user state ─────────────────────────────
# Ignore machine-local IDE cruft; project-shared .vscode/.editor configs
# remain tracked if committed intentionally.
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.history/
.vscode/*.log
.vscode/.bash-history
.vscode/launch.json.local
.ionide/

# ── Misc transient files ────────────────────────────────────
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
*.rej